bathroom accessories. This allows this soap dispenser to blend into any space perfectly.With a net weight of 1.25 Kg these soap dispensers have an inner plastic tank that prevents oxidation and that can be easily removed for cleaning and disinfection purposes.This entire range of soap dispensers is equipped with an anti-drip corrosion resistant valve that dispenses 1.5 ml of soap per service. This anti-drip valve is easily interchangeable with the valves of the other soap dispensers of the same line, so you can easily turn this liquid soap dispenser into a foam or spray soap dispenser.In addition, these soap dispensers have a soap content level display in the front part that constantly indicates the level of soap available inside the soap dispenser.It is recommended to use liquid soaps or disinfectant gel soaps with a density between 0.9 and 1.35 kg/dm3 and a maximum viscosity of 3,000 cps.","Manufacturer":"Mediclinics","OmniClass Number":"23.45.05.00","Type Name":"DJ0031CS","Family Name":"Mediclinics_Liquid soap dispenser_DJ0031x"},"name":"Mediclinics_Liquid soap dispenser_DJ0031x (1)","children":[14775],"rotation":[0.0,0.0,0.0,-1.0]},{"extras":{"Volume":"0.00 m³","Export to IFC":"By Type","IfcGUID":"1yuWWW5pz6ieMe5MuT67Sd","Guid":"7ce20820-173f-46b2-85a8-156e1d187727","Id":"2142421","Phase Created":"New Construction"},"name":"Mediclinics_Liquid soap dispenser_DJ0031x [2142421]","children":[14776],"rotation":[0.5,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5],"translation":[1869.9364013671875,15.748031616210938,-323.1664123535156]},{"extras":{},"children":[14777,14778,14779,14780,14781],"rotation":[0.0,0.0,0.0,-1.0]},{"extras":{},"mesh":7688,"rotation":[0.0,0.0,0.0,-1.0]},{"extras":{},"mesh":7689,"rotation":[0.0,0.0,0.0,-1.0]},{"extras":{},"mesh":7690,"rotation":[0.0,0.0,0.0,-1.0]},{"extras":{},"rotation":[0.0,0.0,0.0,-1.0]},{"extras":{},"rotation":[0.0,0.0,0.0,-1.0]},{"extras":{"Export Type to IFC":"Default","Type IfcGUID":"2vPkMwDYT3QwGa6PfcZamr","Assembly Code":"","OmniClass Number":"","Type 